<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="es" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.160"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">Crazy</text><text for="L2">I like that, you like that, so let's be crazy</text><text for="L3">The contact, impact, I want that daily</text><text for="L4">Our breath getting deeper, deeper, lately</text><text for="L5">I like that, baby</text><text for="L6">'Cause I can't get enough</text><text for="L7">Yeah, I can't get enough</text><text for="L8">Yeah, I can't get enough of your love</text><text for="L9">Give me some more of it</text><text for="L10">I can't get enough, yeah</text><text for="L11">'Cause I can't get enough <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Leggo)</span></text><text for="L12">She says she can't get enough</text><text for="L13">She's out of her mind</text><text for="L14">Come in when she's alone</text><text for="L15">Music to put her in the mood, yeah-yeah</text><text for="L16">She wants us to do it like we did it that one time</text><text for="L17">I got her another drink in case she was thirsty</text><text for="L18">Everything she wears looks nice on her</text><text for="L19">We started walking and now we're riding a jet</text><text for="L20">Let's warm up</text><text for="L21">Baby, you're going to go up and down</text><text for="L22">She doesn't want to forget, she wants to remember it</text><text for="L23">Baby, I want to get inside</text><text for="L24">'Cause I can't get enough</text><text for="L25">Yeah, I can't get enough <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Latino Gang)</span></text><text for="L26">Yeah, I can't get enough of your love</text><text for="L27">Give me some more of it</text><text for="L28">I can't get enough, yeah <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Come on)</span></text><text for="L29">'Cause I can't, can't—</text><text for="L30">Crazy</text><text for="L31">I like that, you like that, so let's be crazy</text><text for="L32">The contact, impact, I want that daily</text><text for="L33">Our breath getting deeper, deeper, lately</text><text for="L34">I like that, baby</text><text for="L35">Yeah</text><text for="L36">Ooh, and no one's gotta know, we can keep it low-key</text><text for="L37">I'll be fine alone, long as you're alone with me <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Tell 'em)</span></text><text for="L38">So incredible, unforgettable on me</text><text for="L39">Keep your body on me <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Leggo, leggo)</span></text><text for="L40">'Cause I can't get enough <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Tainy, come on, Benny, Benny Blanco)</span></text><text for="L41">Yeah, I can't get enough <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(J Balvin, man, Selena)</span></text><text for="L42">Yeah, I can't get enough of your love</text><text for="L43">Give me some more of it</text><text for="L44">I can't get enough, yeah</text><text for="L45">'Cause I can't get enough</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Benjamin Levin</songwriter><songwriter>Cris Chiluiza</songwriter><songwriter>J Balvin</songwriter><songwriter>Jesus M. Nieves Cortez</songwriter><songwriter>Marco Masis</songwriter><songwriter>Mike Sabath</songwriter><songwriter>Selena Gomez</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata>
